{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011Cdso5H3yz4UbA51WzMg7z","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017PpJu71dTLSyvwqi9UQYfR","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-creator-0/87cd2a2d-a4f9-585b-836f-2648df7a6284/scratchpad/e7run/A/e7-p01/infer-ws/distinctions.json","content":"{\n  \"task_id\": \"e7-p01\",\n  \"unresolved_distinctions\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"Q1\",\n      \"question\": \"What is the total number of units across all rows of artifacts/stock.csv?\",\n      \"why_unresolved\": \"The package provides only the raw per-sku rows; no aggregate has been computed or recorded anywhere in the package, so the sum is not yet in evidence.\",\n      \"required_evidence\": \"An integer sum of the units column over all six data rows of stock.csv, derived from the file's actual contents and reproducible by deterministic re-computation.\",\n      \"admissibility_constraints\": [\n        \"Evidence must be derived from package/artifacts/stock.csv itself, covering every data row.\",\n        \"The result must be an integer, matching the deliverable shape for total_units.\",\n        \"No authorship or isolation condition is imposed by the task; evidence produced by the same process that read the package is admissible.\"\n      ],\n      \"evidence_requirement_refs\": [\"E-A\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"features\": {\n        \"locally_resolvable\": true,\n        \"requires_isolation\": false,\n        \"contamination\": false,\n        \"capability_bearing_artifact\": false,\n        \"spans_sessions\": false\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"Q2\",\n      \"question\": \"What is the total value, computed as the sum over rows of units x price, rounded/formatted to 2 decimals?\",\n      \"why_unresolved\": \"The per-row products and their sum are not present in the package; only raw units and price columns exist, and the 2-decimal formatting convention has not yet been applied to any computed figure.\",\n      \"required_evidence\": \"A number equal to the sum of units*price over all data rows of stock.csv, expressed to 2 decimal places, reproducible by deterministic re-computation from the file.\",\n      \"admissibility_constraints\": [\n        \"Evidence must be computed from the units and price columns of package/artifacts/stock.csv, covering every data row.\",\n        \"The value must be stated to 2 decimals as the task specifies.\",\n        \"No authorship or isolation condition is imposed; locally produced arithmetic is admissible.\"\n      ],\n      \"evidence_requirement_refs\": [\"E-B\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"features\": {\n        \"locally_resolvable\": true,\n        \"requires_isolation\": false,\n        \"contamination\": false,\n        \"capability_bearing_artifact\": false,\n        \"spans_sessions\": false\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"Q3\",\n      \"question\": \"Which sku has the most units, applying the tie-break that ties resolve to the smallest sku?\",\n      \"why_unresolved\": \"The maximum of the units column and whether any tie among maxima exists have not been established from the file; the tie-break rule has therefore not yet been exercised or shown inapplicable.\",\n      \"required_evidence\": \"Identification of the maximum units value in stock.csv, enumeration of all skus attaining it, and application of the smallest-sku tie-break if more than one attains it, yielding a single sku string.\",\n      \"admissibility_constraints\": [\n        \"Evidence must consider every data row of package/artifacts/stock.csv when determining the maximum.\",\n        \"If multiple skus share the maximum units, the reported sku must be the smallest under the task's tie-break ordering; the evidence must show the tie set examined.\",\n        \"No authorship or isolation condition is imposed; local determination is admissible.\"\n      ],\n      \"evidence_requirement_refs